{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "thalamus_vllm",
    "project": "thalamus"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "Thalamus vllm"
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate Interval",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "15m",
          "name": "rate_interval"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "TextVariable",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Rate Multiplier (per-second → per-hour = 3600)",
            "hidden": false
          },
          "value": "1",
          "name": "rate_multiplier"
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "readme": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "README"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "Markdown",
            "spec": {
              "text": "# Thalamus Debug — vLLM\n\nDiagnostic metrics from the vLLM model server — explains **why** when the SLO dashboard shows a breach. Everything here is vLLM's internal view, per `model_name`; the router-side view lives in Debug/llm_d.\n\nA vLLM request has three phases: **queue** (waiting in the scheduler) → **prefill** (processing the prompt) → **decode** (generating tokens). Each phase has its own panels.\n\n## Variables\n\n- `rate_interval` controls the smoothing window for histogram/counter rates. Shorter windows expose bursts; longer windows smooth sparse traffic.\n- `rate_multiplier` scales counter rates, which Prometheus always returns per second. Use `1` for per-second, `60` for per-minute, or `3600` for per-hour values. Axis labels remain in their default per-second units."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "queue_time_p50": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Queue Time p50",
            "description": "Median time a request spends in the scheduler before prefill starts."
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "mode": "list",
                "position": "bottom"
              },
              "visual": {
                "areaOpacity": 0.1,
                "connectNulls": false,
                "display": "line",
                "lineStyle": "solid",
                "lineWidth": 1.5,
                "pointRadius": 2
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "format": {
                  "unit": "seconds"
                },
                "min": 0,
                "show": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "datasource": {
                      "kind": "PrometheusDatasource"
                    },
                    "query": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (model_name, le) (rate(vllm:request_queue_time_seconds_bucket[$rate_interval])))",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{model_name}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
